## Arquitetura

### Diagrama de alto nível

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    API["FastAPI"] --> Cycle["Trading Cycle"]
    Scheduler["APScheduler"] --> Cycle
    Cycle --> Markets["Markets Module"]
    Cycle --> News["News Module"]
    Cycle --> Research["Research Agent"]
    Cycle --> Risk["Risk Agent"]
    Cycle --> Decision["Decision Engine"]
    Decision --> Executor["Executor Interface"]
    Executor --> Paper["PaperExecutor"]
    Executor --> Binance["BinanceExecutor"]
    Markets --> BinanceREST["Binance Spot REST"]
    Markets --> BinanceWS["Binance Spot WebSocket"]
    Research --> LLM["LLM Provider Interface"]
    News --> NewsProvider["News Provider Interface"]
    Cycle --> DB["SQLAlchemy + PostgreSQL"]
    Cycle --> Audit["Audit Logs"]
```

### Sequência do trading cycle

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Job as run_trading_cycle
    participant Markets as MarketsService
    participant News as NewsService
    participant Research as ResearchAgent
    participant Risk as RiskAgent
    participant Decision as DecisionEngine
    participant Executor as PaperExecutor
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Job->>Markets: collect_snapshot(symbol)
    Markets->>DB: save MarketSnapshot
    Job->>News: find_recent_by_symbol(symbol)
    Job->>Research: generate(symbol, market, news)
    Research->>DB: save Thesis
    Job->>Risk: evaluate(thesis, market, limits)
    Risk->>DB: save RiskEvaluation
    Job->>Decision: decide(thesis, risk, market)
    alt mode = paper and approved
      Job->>Executor: execute(order)
      Executor->>DB: save Trade
      Executor->>DB: update Position
    else no trade
      Job-->>Job: skip execution
    end
    Job->>DB: save AuditLog and JobRun
```

### Módulos

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Main["app/main.py"] --> Config["config/"]
    Main --> Jobs["jobs/"]
